%% TRIP-003 Admin: cabin classes and add-ons (the same flow for both)
flowchart TD
    Card[Card Klasser och addons<br/>R1] --> Add[Lägg till<br/>R2, R6]
    Card --> Edit[Pencil<br/>R4, R8]
    Card --> Trash[Trash can<br/>R5, R9]
    Add --> Form[Fields with Spara and Avbryt]
    Edit --> Form
    Form -- Avbryt --> Card
    Form -- Spara --> Valid{Valid and unique name?<br/>R3, R7}
    Valid -- no --> Error[Error message in the row]
    Error --> Form
    Valid -- yes --> Saved[Saved, table updated] --> Card
    Trash --> InUse{In use?}
    InUse -- yes --> Blocked[Du kan ej ta bort + reason, OK]
    Blocked --> Card
    InUse -- no --> Sure{Är du säker?}
    Sure -- Nej --> Card
    Sure -- Ja --> Deleted[Deleted] --> Card
